<decision #track.wire_decisions_validate.wire_into_validate apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "planning-decision" priority = "P0" status = "accepted" blocks = ["src/cli/commands/validate.ts" "test/cli/commands/validate.test.ts"] frontier = false durable_candidate = false confidence = 0.95 reversibility = "reversible" } (
  <question ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBYZ>
  如何让 track 创建时拦截 decisions.xnl 的 XNL 语法错误？
  </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBYZ>
  <recommendation ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ0>
  复用 validateDecisionsFile 接线进 codument validate 的 track 校验面：plan-track 收尾的 best-effort validate 自动覆盖 decisions，无需改提示词。
  </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ0>
  <options {  } [
    <option { key = "wire-cli" recommended = true } (
      <title ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ1>
      接线进 codument validate
      </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ1>
      <description ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ2>
      validateCommand 的 track 循环内对 decisions.xnl / decisions/ source set 调用 validateDecisionsFile。
      </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ2>
      <tradeoff ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ3>
      需要一次 CLI 改动与测试；但创建即拦截，且 plan-track 提示词零改动。
      </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ3>
    )>
    <option { key = "prompt-only" } (
      <title ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ4>
      改 plan-track 收尾提示词
      </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ4>
      <description ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ5>
      在 §3.8 加一句"另跑 codument decisions validate"。
      </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ5>
      <tradeoff ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ6>
      堆提示词、依赖模型自觉执行，违背 CLI 优先原则。
      </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ6>
    )>
  ]>
  <answer ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ7>
  接线进 codument validate。
  </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ7>
  <rationale ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ8>
  plan-track 收尾已固定跑 codument validate；把 decisions 并入该校验面即可零提示词改动覆盖，符合既有原则。
  </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ8>
  <evidence ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ9>
  plan-track.md §3.8 L568 的 best-effort validate 只跑 codument validate；decisions.ts 已导出 validateDecisionsFile 且与 validate.ts 无循环依赖。
  </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZ9>
)>

<decision #track.wire_decisions_validate.closer_hint apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { kind = "planning-decision" priority = "P1" status = "accepted" blocks = ["src/cli/commands/decisions.ts"] frontier = false durable_candidate = false confidence = 0.9 reversibility = "reversible" } (
  <question ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZA>
  decisions 的 XNL 语法错误提示是否需要可操作化？
  </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZA>
  <recommendation ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZB>
  在 parseXnl 失败路径的消息中追加 XNL 文本块闭合写法提示：闭合 marker 是反引号问号形式（斜杠加问号的尖括号闭合），而非 XML 风格的标签名对称闭合。
  </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZB>
  <options {  } [
    <option { key = "add-hint" recommended = true } (
      <title ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZC>
      追加闭合提示
      </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZC>
      <description ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZD>
      错误消息指向具体的 XNL 闭合写法，AI 可直接据提示修正。
      </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZD>
      <tradeoff ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZE>
      消息略长；但降低"Missing closing ')'"这类解析器原文的困惑。
      </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZE>
    )>
    <option { key = "raw-only" } (
      <title ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZF>
      保持解析器原文
      </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZF>
      <description ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZG>
      不加包装提示。
      </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZG>
      <tradeoff ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZH>
      本次归档正是被该原文卡住，可操作提示价值明确。
      </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZH>
    )>
  ]>
  <answer ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZJ>
  追加闭合提示。
  </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZJ>
  <rationale ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZK>
  xnl-core 的 "Missing closing ')' for extend" 不指向"闭合标签写错"这一实际原因；AI 友好输出应给出可操作修复提示。
  </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZK>
  <evidence ?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZM>
  归档时实际报错原文即 Missing closing 右括号；根因是 14 处把 XNL 文本块闭合误写成 XML 风格的标签名闭合。
  </?01M02EGVBQBRSJ9MN5TKHCPBZM>
)>
